    - target: {fileID: 3721352779316844074, guid: 444719d241a145d409b8f57fe4918b6c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message.localizedTexts.Array.data[0].text
      value: "Ah, ent\xE3o esta \xE9 a tua casa, mi\xFAdo. Um lugar agrad\xE1vel
        que tens aqui, hein? Faz-me confus\xE3o por que alguma vez deixarias este
        local pac\xEDfico para servir no ex\xE9rcito. Mas, ei, cada um com a sua
        loucura!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3721352779316844074, guid: 444719d241a145d409b8f57fe4918b6c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message.localizedTexts.Array.data[1].text
      value: Ah, so this is your home, kid. Nice little thing you got goin', huh?
        Makes you wonder why you'd ever leave this peaceful place to serve in the
        army. But hey, to each his own.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
