  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f33307f434879de43aaab010e52d9b19, type: 2}
  message: Big footprints... like a bear's. That's odd... and a bit scary. I don't
    think we've had bears around these parts in like... forever. I should follow
    them. Might lead me to our chickens... although it's more probable I'll find
    their drumsticks instead.
  responses: []
